{{!
    @template tool_lp/user_competency_summary

    The summary of a user competency outside a plan or a course, overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/user_competency_summary of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/user_competency_summary.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every
    core upgrade. tool_lp/renderer renders it on user_competency.php, and tool_lp/user_competency_info
    re-renders it through core/templates after a rating or a change of review status and replaces the
    root element with the answer. Its sibling user_competency_summary_in_plan is not overridden: it carries
    the same proficiency badge, which scss/competency.scss gives the pill's shape and an icon
    (user_competency_summary_in_course has a copy of its own).

    Kept from core, because tool_lp's modules read them: the root's data-region="user-competency-full-info",
    data-node="user-competency" with data-competencyid and data-userid (tool_lp/user_competency_workflow
    reads the ids off that ancestor and throws unless exactly one carries the node, so nothing inside
    may carry it again) and
    data-region-id="<uniqid>" (the reloader's root); data-region="competency-summary";
    data-region="user-competency-status" around the four review buttons, which the workflow finds
    inside it by data-action="request-review", "cancel-review-request", "start-review" and
    "stop-review"; the rate button's id rate_<uniqid>, which tool_lp/grade_user_competency_inline
    binds; data-region="evidence-listing"; the partials tool_lp/competency_summary,
    tool_lp/comment_area and tool_lp/evidence_summary; the JavaScript, statement for statement, with
    the callback's parameters capitalised and two lines wrapped (core's copy has no example context,
    so the lint never read it; this one is linted, and refuses a lower-case constructor). Kept for Behat: a dl
    whose dt "Proficient" is followed by a dd holding the proficiency's name ("Yes", "No") and whose dt
    "Rating" is followed by a dd holding the rating's name (tool_lp's "competency page proficiency" and
    "competency page rating" selectors). Every context key keeps core's double stash.
    Changed: the facts are a definition grid (dim-comp-meta); the review buttons are a row of small
    buttons; proficiency is a pill that says the state in words and with an icon (proficient: a check
    on the success family; rated and not proficient: an exclamation on the warning family; not rated:
    a minus on the neutral family) where core drew a red or green badge; the rating is a pill with a
    star, or a "Not rated" pill in place of core's dash; no evidence is a quiet paragraph.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * usercompetency - competencyid, userid, statusname, grade, gradename, proficiency,
      proficiencyname, reviewer, isstatusinreview and the four is*allowed review flags
    * competency - a competency_summary record (with competency.id and scaleid)
    * user - id
    * cangrade - boolean
    * commentarea - the comment area, if any
    * evidence - array of evidence_summary records

    Example context (json):
    {
        "usercompetency": {
            "competencyid": 1,
            "userid": 3,
            "statusname": "Waiting for review",
            "grade": 2,
            "gradename": "Competent",
            "proficiency": true,
            "proficiencyname": "Yes",
            "isstatusinreview": false,
            "isrequestreviewallowed": false,
            "iscancelreviewrequestallowed": true,
            "isstartreviewallowed": true,
            "isstopreviewallowed": false
        },
        "competency": {
            "competency": {"id": 1, "shortname": "Communicate clearly", "idnumber": "COMM-1"},
            "framework": {"shortname": "Professional skills"},
            "taxonomyterm": "Competency",
            "scaleid": 2
        },
        "user": {"id": 3},
        "cangrade": true,
        "evidence": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "userdate": "Tuesday, 13 October 2026, 10:04",
                "grade": 2,
                "gradename": "Competent",
                "description": "The competency was rated manually.",
                "candelete": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="user-competency-full-info" class="dim-comp-ucsummary" data-node="user-competency" data-competencyid="{{usercompetency.competencyid}}" data-userid="{{usercompetency.userid}}" data-region-id="{{uniqid}}">
    <div data-region="competency-summary">
        {{#competency}}
            {{> tool_lp/competency_summary }}
        {{/competency}}
        <dl class="dim-comp-meta">
            {{#usercompetency}}
            <dt>{{#str}}reviewstatus, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
            <dd data-region="user-competency-status">
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--status">{{statusname}}</span>
                {{#isstatusinreview}}
                    <span class="dim-comp-muted">{{reviewer.fullname}}</span>
                {{/isstatusinreview}}
                <span class="dim-comp-actions">
                {{#isrequestreviewallowed}}<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="request-review">{{#str}}requestreview, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>{{/isrequestreviewallowed}}
                {{#iscancelreviewrequestallowed}}<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="cancel-review-request">{{#str}}cancelreviewrequest, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>{{/iscancelreviewrequestallowed}}
                {{#isstartreviewallowed}}<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="start-review">{{#str}}startreview, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>{{/isstartreviewallowed}}
                {{#isstopreviewallowed}}<button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" data-action="stop-review">{{#str}}stopreview, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>{{/isstopreviewallowed}}
                </span>
            </dd>
            <dt>{{#str}}proficient, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
            <dd>
                {{#proficiency}}
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--proficient">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{proficiencyname}}
                </span>
                {{/proficiency}}
                {{^proficiency}}
                {{#grade}}
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notproficient">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{proficiencyname}}
                </span>
                {{/grade}}
                {{^grade}}
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notrated">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{proficiencyname}}
                </span>
                {{/grade}}
                {{/proficiency}}
            </dd>
            <dt>{{#str}}rating, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
            <dd>
                <span class="dim-comp-pills">
                {{#grade}}
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--rated">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{gradename}}
                </span>
                {{/grade}}
                {{^grade}}
                <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notrated">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{#str}}notrated, report_competency{{/str}}
                </span>
                {{/grade}}
                {{#cangrade}}
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="rate_{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}rate, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>
                {{/cangrade}}
                </span>
            </dd>
            {{#js}}
            require(['jquery', 'tool_lp/grade_user_competency_inline', 'tool_lp/user_competency_info',
                    'tool_lp/user_competency_workflow'], function($, Mod, Info, UserCompWorkflow) {

                var competencyElement = $('[data-region-id="{{uniqid}}"]');
                var infoReloader = new Info(competencyElement, '{{competency.competency.id}}', '{{user.id}}');

                var ucw = new UserCompWorkflow();
                ucw.registerEvents('[data-region="user-competency-status"]');
                ucw.on('status-changed', infoReloader.reload.bind(infoReloader));
                ucw.on('error-occured', infoReloader.reload.bind(infoReloader));
                {{#cangrade}}
                    var inlineGrader = new Mod('#rate_{{uniqid}}', '{{competency.scaleid}}', '{{competency.competency.id}}', '{{user.id}}',
                        '{{plan.id}}', '', '{{#str}}chooserating, tool_lp{{/str}}');
                    inlineGrader.on('competencyupdated', infoReloader.reload.bind(infoReloader));
                {{/cangrade}}
            });
            {{/js}}
            {{/usercompetency}}
        </dl>
        {{#commentarea}}
            {{#canpostorhascomments}}
                {{>tool_lp/comment_area}}
            {{/canpostorhascomments}}
        {{/commentarea}}
        <dl data-region="evidence-listing" class="dim-comp-evidence-listing">
            <dt class="dim-comp-eyebrow">{{#str}}evidence, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
            <dd>
                {{#evidence}}
                    {{> tool_lp/evidence_summary }}
                {{/evidence}}
                {{^evidence}}
                    <p class="dim-comp-evidence-empty">{{#str}}noevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
                {{/evidence}}
            </dd>
        </dl>
    </div>
</div>
